sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant ORCH as Orchestrator
    participant STORE as ConvStore
    participant LINKER as SchemaLinker
    participant INTENT as IntentExtractor<br/>(PydanticAI)
    participant PLAN as QueryPlanner<br/>(Deterministic)
    participant SQLGEN as SQLGenerator<br/>(PydanticAI)
    participant VALID as SQLValidator<br/>(SQLGlot AST)
    participant DB as DatabaseAdapter
    participant ANAL as ResultAnalyser
    participant VIZ as VizGenerator
    participant FOLLOW as FollowUpEngine

    User->>FE: "Show revenue by region, last quarter"
    FE->>API: POST /query {question, session_id}
    API->>ORCH: run(question, session_id)

    ORCH->>STORE: get_or_create(session_id)
    STORE-->>ORCH: ConversationState (turns, active_context)

    Note over ORCH: Stage 1: Schema Linking
    ORCH->>LINKER: link(question, scl_manager)
    LINKER->>LINKER: ChromaDB query × 4 doctypes
    LINKER->>LINKER: BM25 query × 4 doctypes
    LINKER->>LINKER: RRF merge (k=60)
    LINKER->>LINKER: Security re-check vs allowlist
    LINKER-->>ORCH: SchemaContext {tables, metrics, glossary, examples}

    Note over ORCH: Stage 2: Intent Extraction (LLM #1)
    ORCH->>INTENT: extract(question, schema_ctx, edition_ctx)
    INTENT->>INTENT: PydanticAI → LLM call
    INTENT->>INTENT: Validate AnalyticalIntent cross-fields
    INTENT-->>ORCH: AnalyticalIntent {AGGREGATION, measures=[revenue], dims=[region], time=LAST_QUARTER}

    Note over ORCH: Stage 3: Query Planning (Deterministic)
    ORCH->>PLAN: plan(intent, schema_ctx, conv_state)
    PLAN->>PLAN: Resolve tables + joins
    PLAN->>PLAN: Expand measures to SQL expressions
    PLAN->>PLAN: Generate dialect time filters (PostgreSQL)
    PLAN->>PLAN: Build ResolvedFilters
    PLAN-->>ORCH: QueryPlan {dialect, tables, joins, measures, time_resolution}

    loop Retry loop (max: llm_max_retries)
        Note over ORCH: Stage 4: SQL Generation (LLM #2)
        ORCH->>SQLGEN: generate(query_plan)
        SQLGEN->>SQLGEN: PydanticAI → LLM call
        SQLGEN->>SQLGEN: Strip code fences
        SQLGEN-->>ORCH: raw SQL string

        Note over ORCH,VALID: Stage 5: SQL Validation ★ SECURITY BOUNDARY
        ORCH->>VALID: validate(sql, dialect)
        VALID->>VALID: SQLGlot AST parse
        VALID->>VALID: Rule 1: SELECT-only?
        VALID->>VALID: Rule 2: Single statement?
        VALID->>VALID: Rule 3: No system schemas?
        VALID->>VALID: Rule 4: Tables in allowlist?
        VALID->>VALID: Rule 5: No dangerous functions?
        VALID->>VALID: Rule 6: Subquery depth ≤ max?

        alt Security violation
            VALID-->>ORCH: SecurityViolation
            ORCH-->>API: UADAResponse {error: security_rejected}
            Note over ORCH: EXIT — no retry
        else Validation OK
            VALID->>VALID: Inject LIMIT if missing
            VALID-->>ORCH: ValidationResult.OK + safe_sql

            Note over ORCH: Stage 6: Execution
            ORCH->>DB: execute_query(safe_sql, timeout=30s, max_rows=1000)
            alt Timeout
                DB-->>ORCH: QueryTimeoutError
                ORCH-->>API: UADAResponse {error: timeout}
                Note over ORCH: EXIT — no retry
            else Execution error
                DB-->>ORCH: QueryExecutionError {repair_hint}
                ORCH->>SQLGEN: repair(sql, repair_hint)
                Note over ORCH: Loop back to Stage 4
            else Success
                DB-->>ORCH: QueryExecutionResult {columns, rows, is_truncated}
            end
        end
    end

    Note over ORCH: Stage 7: Result Analysis
    ORCH->>ANAL: analyse(exec_result, intent)
    ANAL->>ANAL: Pandas DataFrame
    ANAL->>ANAL: Numeric summaries
    ANAL->>ANAL: Trend detection
    ANAL->>ANAL: Outlier detection (z-score > 3)
    ANAL->>ANAL: Narrative generation
    ANAL-->>ORCH: AnalysedResult {summaries, trend, outliers, narrative, key_finding}

    Note over ORCH: Stage 8: Visualization
    ORCH->>VIZ: generate(analysed_result, intent)
    VIZ->>VIZ: Deterministic selection tree
    alt LLM needed
        VIZ->>VIZ: LLM call #3 (fallback)
    end
    VIZ-->>ORCH: VegaLiteSpec | VisualisationFallback

    Note over ORCH: Stage 9: Follow-up Suggestions
    ORCH->>FOLLOW: suggest(intent, analysed_result, conv_state)
    FOLLOW-->>ORCH: list[str] 3-5 suggestions

    ORCH->>STORE: save(turn, active_context)
    ORCH-->>API: UADAResponse {intent, sql, result, viz, suggestions}
    API-->>FE: JSON response
    FE-->>User: Chart + insights + suggestion chips
